    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672710/extras/b0aedf750673584737a4c71e09fc4e25.avif?t=1755614945\" width=616 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >in Grizzly Golfers there is <strong>only one goal</strong> and that's to <strong>win from you friends at all cost.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672710/extras/57c2768843c882cb345c4aa364856fb5.poster.avif?t=1755614945\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672710/extras/57c2768843c882cb345c4aa364856fb5.webm?t=1755614945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672710/extras/57c2768843c882cb345c4aa364856fb5.mp4?t=1755614945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Whack</strong> them with you <strong>golfclub</strong> or <strong>steal their ball</strong>, as long as <strong>you defeat them</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >tired of getting whacked by your friends?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672710/extras/0056ffd5a87a59243da4f83202090a20.poster.avif?t=1755614945\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672710/extras/0056ffd5a87a59243da4f83202090a20.webm?t=1755614945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672710/extras/0056ffd5a87a59243da4f83202090a20.mp4?t=1755614945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > blow them up in\u00a0<strong>Area Mode</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose A Punishment For The Next Golf Course:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672710/extras/4ffbb53618d0c871decf9f2582f1edc6.poster.avif?t=1755614945\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672710/extras/4ffbb53618d0c871decf9f2582f1edc6.webm?t=1755614945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672710/extras/4ffbb53618d0c871decf9f2582f1edc6.mp4?t=1755614945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >pick a card after each hole to add a new &quot;effect&quot; to the next course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Or Just Mini Golf:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >there's also casual minigolf, no cards. just golfing with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672710/extras/071eb56fd1168f7e4e9b63e78067531a.poster.avif?t=1755614945\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672710/extras/071eb56fd1168f7e4e9b63e78067531a.webm?t=1755614945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672710/extras/071eb56fd1168f7e4e9b63e78067531a.mp4?t=1755614945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >play trough all kinds of entertaining levels, where you and your friends can play golf.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
